Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3-numpy
Recommends: python3-pil
Description: headless GLSL multipass renderer for small Linux devices
 ghee compiles a set of fragment shaders (a scene), renders them
 off-screen with GLES2 through DRM/GBM, and writes the pixels to image
 files, SPI panels, or an MJPEG stream. No window system required.
 .
 Ships the ghee CLI and a browser-based live shader console.
